### Crear entregable para una tarea existente -> 201 (estado EN_PROCESO, fecha_inicio = ahora si no se envía)
POST {{baseUrl}}/entregables
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tarea_id": 1,
  "total": 1500.50,
  "observaciones": "Primera entrega"
}

### Con fechas explícitas -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/entregables
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tarea_id": 1,
  "fecha_inicio": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "fecha_fin": "2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "total": 2300
}

### Tarea inexistente -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/entregables
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tarea_id": 999999
}

### Sin tarea_id -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/entregables
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observaciones": "Sin tarea"
}

### Estado fuera del ENUM -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/entregables
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tarea_id": 1,
  "estado": "PERDIDO"
}
